Package: ACItools
Title: Adaptive Capacity Index Calculation from Species Traits and Abundance Data
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Luis Enrique", "Angeles Gonzalez", email = "luis.angeles0612@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: 
    Tools to calculate species-level and community-level Adaptive Capacity Index (ACI) 
    based on species trait data and abundance data. The package includes functions 
    for trait standardisation, variable selection using correlation and PCA, and 
    abundance-weighted community-level ACI estimation.
